From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: slothfulchat <patches@slothfulchat.invalid>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 00:37:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 86/90] web-app: stop a running download from its progress ring
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The progress ring gets an × button calling abort_download. It takes the
percentage's place on hover/focus, and for good on touch devices or
before the first percentage arrives; the arc keeps showing progress.
---
 _locales/_untranslated_en.json                |  3 +
 .../_message-download-placeholder.scss        | 40 ++++++++++++
 .../message/DownloadOnDemandPlaceholder.tsx   | 64 +++++++++++++++----
 .../src/components/message/Message.tsx        | 11 ++++
 4 files changed, 104 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/_locales/_untranslated_en.json b/_locales/_untranslated_en.json
index ea3bd34..2f6785a 100644
--- a/_locales/_untranslated_en.json
+++ b/_locales/_untranslated_en.json
@@ -175,5 +175,8 @@
